        </div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <h2 id="gates">Pass The 3 Gates before you commit real years to this path</h2>

  <p>
    The 4-Checkpoint Protocol tells you whether merchant navy fits on paper. The 3 Gates make you test it in the
    real world before you commit years of training and a real education budget to it.
  </p>

